  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BeFem - Feminist Resilience: Women&apos;s Voices Rising</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&#x2019;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation BeFem is implementing the 9- month project &quot;Feminist Resilience: Women&apos;s Voices Rising&quot;. The aim of the project is to bolster the resilience of WROs, LGBT+ organizations, and feminist movements, while also advocating for the widespread adoption of the feminist narrative to address the challenges posed by anti-democratic movements and further the goals of gender equality and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
